{"version":1,"key":"card:569","content":{"id":569,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a3ed8607-7191-48b8-9fa5-e58ec7d060a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通常加载 CSS 是同步阻塞的，在解析到 CSS 资源时，会阻止已处理内容的渲染，直至 CSS 加载并解析完成，构建 CSSOM 树，和 DOM 树形成渲染树后绘制到页面上。"}]},{"type":"mermaid","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","chart":"graph LR\n    A[HTML 解析] --> B[DOM 构建]\n    C[CSS 解析] --> D[CSSOM 构建]\n    B --> E[渲染树]\n    D --> E\n    E --> F[布局]\n    F --> G[绘制]\n    G --> H[合成]","collabId":"bd706bd0-167b-4f52-adba-e7023b580372","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6483f648-406f-4cb1-803d-a578b0fc1833","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设 CSS 是异步加载的，那么就会出现一开始没样式，然后闪一下出现样式的情况（Flash of Unstyle Content，FOUC），这样的体验是不好的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"744caf7e-3731-4acd-a82c-a908ead5601b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于页面的渲染是边解析边渲染，因此如果把 CSS 放到后面也会导致 FOUC，因此一般把样式文件的加载都放到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"head"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签中。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a0764c16-1cff-4f79-a4c8-c18910a3ff07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了不影响页面渲染速度，有的时候只使用一些基本的 CSS 样式，异步加载其他的 CSS 样式，有哪些方法可以异步加载 CSS 呢："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a6536a3e-000b-4981-bc2d-2a617c5e9326","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9b95019c-0e0f-4009-9680-3ba8ec6bf462","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"079b0a9b-b6c2-4790-a548-d2a1d0afe1d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"link"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"media"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，在不符合条件的时候，浏览器会异步加载样式，我们可以监听事件，在资源加载完成后，将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"media"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"all"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"a2d23437-20b9-49a8-bb01-11e10eb6fe44","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"07d2cbd8-0003-4d25-9a2e-f627371a7221","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<link href=\"style.css\" ref=\"stylesheet\" media=\"none\" onload=\"this.media='all'\" />","collabId":"6fda9b70-faec-4625-830c-529d336668b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7372490f-a573-4d44-8b77-cd92c31b84c5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3e3b6173-693b-4a6f-a368-24eb7d1798ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"JavaScript"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"link"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签，动态加载 CSS"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"4f79127b-506e-44bd-99aa-4bee787a1a04","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"499a68d2-75be-422d-808d-b83e07628e81","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const link = document.createElement